@MelodyFlowApiHostAddress = http://localhost:5032
@projectId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@jobId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Comprobar que la API alcanza PostgreSQL
GET {{MelodyFlowApiHostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Crear un proyecto
POST {{MelodyFlowApiHostAddress}}/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Late Night Lofi",
  "genre": "Lo-fi",
  "mood": "Calm",
  "targetDurationSeconds": 3600
}

### Crear un trabajo musical (sustituye projectId por el ID anterior)
POST {{MelodyFlowApiHostAddress}}/api/v1/generation-jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: local-test-lofi-001

{
  "musicProjectId": "{{projectId}}",
  "jobType": "Music",
  "requestedParameters": {
    "variationSeed": 12345
  }
}

### Consultar un trabajo
GET {{MelodyFlowApiHostAddress}}/api/v1/generation-jobs/{{jobId}}
Accept: application/json

### Solicitar cancelación
POST {{MelodyFlowApiHostAddress}}/api/v1/generation-jobs/{{jobId}}/cancellation
Accept: application/json
